<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79320" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρελαύνω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεκ-ελάω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρήλᾰσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.638
				</span></i>
			, 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρέλασσα</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				382
			</span></i> :—<i>drive by</i> or <i>past</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναντίω δύ᾽ ἅρματε π</span>. <i>drive</i>
			them <i>past</i> one another, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1129
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὸν ἵππον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					5.3.55
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς αἶγας παρελᾶντα</span> (
				Dor.
			
			pres.
			part.) <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.89
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				3.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as if intr.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>drive by</i> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρον, ἅρμα,
				ἵππους</span>, etc.), <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.382
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				427
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <i>drive past, overtake</i> another, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴοισίν μ᾽ἵπποισι παρήλασαν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				638
			</span></i> ; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. Τρηχῖνα</span>
			<i>drive on</i> to Trachis, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				353
			</span></i> ; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐφ᾽ ἅρματος, ἐφ᾽
			ἵππου</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.2.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.4.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>row</i> or <i>sail past</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρήλασε νηΐ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.186
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> c. acc. pers.,
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σειρῆνας] παρήλασαν</span> ib.
				<i><span class="en">
				197
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in Prose,
				<i>ride by, run by</i>, c. acc., freq. in <i><span class="en">X.,
					<u>An.</u>1.2.17</span></i>, al.;
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰς τάξεις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				3.5.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> less freq.,
				<i>ride up to, rush towards</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς
				αὑτόν, ἐπὶ τοὺς πολεμίους</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				4.2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				8.18
			</span></i> ; <i>ride on one's way, Cyr.</i><i><span class="en">
				3.3.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
